# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Novogenics Clinical Platform — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env.local (never commit .env.local)
# All variables must be prefixed VITE_ to be exposed to the
# browser bundle at build time.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Admin SDK / Firebase CLI (server-side only, never VITE_) ──
# Path to your service account JSON key.
# Get it from: Firebase Console → Project Settings → Service Accounts
# → Generate new private key → Save as service-account.json in project root
# This file is gitignored. Never commit it.
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./service-account.json

# ── Email notifications ──────────────────────────────────────
# Email is sent SERVER-SIDE via Resend (Cloud Functions) — no client
# email keys are needed. Set the Resend key on the functions, not here:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set RESEND_API_KEY
# and verify the novogenics.co.uk sending domain in Resend → Domains
# (add the DNS records it lists). The clinic recipients for admin/contact-form
# emails are set in functions/src/emailService.ts (CLINIC_RECIPIENTS).
